LICENSE NOT YET SELECTED
========================

This placeholder is intentional. No license has been chosen for this repository
yet, which means no license is granted: by default, all rights are reserved and
others may not copy, modify, or redistribute this work.

Replace this file with the intended license text before publishing.

Note that code and benchmark data may warrant different terms. A common choice
for a benchmark release is a permissive code license (MIT or Apache-2.0) paired
with a data license such as CC BY 4.0 for the task catalog; if you do that, say
explicitly in README.md which terms cover which paths.

Third-party benchmarks used for transfer evaluation are NOT contained in this
repository and are NOT covered by whatever license is chosen here. They carry
their own terms upstream. See docs/EXTERNAL_BENCHMARKS.md.
